### PHASE 20: RESOURCE AUTHORIZATION & INPUT CHECKS

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@ownerAToken = Bearer <OWNER_A_JWT>
@collabAToken = Bearer <COLLAB_A_JWT>
@userBToken = Bearer <USER_B_JWT>
@adminMentorToken = Bearer <ADMIN_WITH_MENTOR_APPS_JWT>
@adminUsersOnlyToken = Bearer <ADMIN_USERS_ONLY_JWT>
@superUserToken = Bearer <SUPERUSER_JWT>
@unverifiedToken = Bearer <UNVERIFIED_USER_JWT>
@projAId = proj-1
@projBId = <PROJECT_B_ID>
@taskBId = <TASK_B_ID>
@notifAId = <NOTIF_A_ID>

### 1. Project A owner blocked from creating task in Project B (403 NOT_A_PROJECT_MEMBER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: {{ownerAToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "{{projBId}}",
  "title": "Unauthorized Task",
  "dueDate": "2028-06-01"
}

### 2. Project A collaborator blocked from editing/deleting task in Project B (403 NOT_A_PROJECT_MEMBER)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskBId}}
Authorization: {{collabAToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tampered Task"
}

### 3. Task ID queried with mismatched projectId returns 404 TASK_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskBId}}?projectId={{projAId}}
Authorization: {{userBToken}}

### 4. New task created directly in "In Review" rejected (400 INVALID_INITIAL_STATUS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: {{ownerAToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "{{projAId}}",
  "title": "Pre-approved task bypass",
  "dueDate": "2028-06-01",
  "status": "In Review"
}

### 5. Task comment with banned phrase rejected (400 CONTENT_NOT_ALLOWED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/task-2/comments
Authorization: {{collabAToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Comment containing blocked phrase"
}

### 6. User B reading/marking/deleting User A's notification returns 404 NOTIFICATION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notifAId}}
Authorization: {{userBToken}}

### 7. Non-admin POST /notifications blocked (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: {{collabAToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "1",
  "message": "Attempted spoofed notification"
}

### 8. Admin/Super User POST /notifications with 10-500 char body succeeds (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "1",
  "title": "System Notice",
  "message": "Scheduled platform maintenance will occur at 11 PM UTC."
}

### 9. CV download requires applicant, admin with mentor_apps, or Super User (403 for revenue/users-only admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/uploads/cv/sample.pdf
Authorization: {{adminUsersOnlyToken}}

### 10. Unverified user blocked on invite accept, mentor application, report, dispute, and data export (403 EMAIL_NOT_VERIFIED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/export
Authorization: {{unverifiedToken}}
